# The view stick's turn rate at full and half tilt, and the move stick's speed from just past its dead zone to
# full tilt. Start a map, e.g. 'DM-Deck16][?Game=Botpack.DeathMatchPlus'; rate.py reads the watch lines.
waitlog up for play
sleep 3
pad attach
sleep 1
probe start
pad axis rightx 32767
sleep 0.5
watch 200 turn-full
sleep 4
pad axis rightx 16384
sleep 0.5
watch 200 turn-half
sleep 4
pad axis rightx 0
# The match starts on Fire (the right trigger in DefUser.ini's layout, the A button in a retail User.ini).
pad axis righttrigger 32767
pad button a 1
sleep 0.3
pad axis righttrigger 0
pad button a 0
sleep 5
pad axis lefty -6000
sleep 1.5
watch 80 move-0.18
sleep 1.5
pad axis lefty -16384
sleep 1.5
watch 80 move-0.5
sleep 1.5
pad axis lefty -32767
sleep 1.5
watch 80 move-full
sleep 1.5
pad axis lefty 0
probe end
